  "content": "<p>這個模組為《Minecraft》中的各種裝備添加了額外的工具統計資訊到提示框中。該模組可進行配置，允許禁用某些資訊。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>目前功能</p><ul>\n<li>採集等級（僅限於分層物品，如鎬）</li>\n<li>挖掘效率（僅限於分層物品，如鎬）</li>\n<li>附魔能力（在附魔台GUI中顯示於所有可附魔物品上）</li>\n<li>工具耐久度（在工具受損時顯示）</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/287/441/screenshot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>喜歡這個模組並想支持我嗎？</strong></p><ul>\n<li>在<a href=\"https://twitter.com/DarkhaxDev\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a>上關注我</li>\n<li>加入我的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></li>\n<li>在<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>上贊助我</li>\n<li>查看我的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">網站</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://nodecraft.com/r/darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://nodecraft.com/assets/images/logo-dark.png\" width=\"384\" height=\"90\"></a><br>此項目由Nodecraft贊助。使用優惠碼<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://nodecraft.com/r/darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Darkhax</a>可享首月服務30%折扣！<img src=\"https://skulk.blmj.red/tool-stats\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>標誌由<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgame-icons.net%252f1x1%252florc%252fsword-spade.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lorc</a>於Game Icons提供，並根據<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC By 3.0</a>許可證授權。</p>",
